00:12:09.593 --> 00:12:11.765
I think that you're
a little bit confused and that you need to leave.


00:12:11.834 --> 00:12:14.248
I remembered someone
who lived here.


00:12:14.351 --> 00:12:15.937
That was a long time ago.


00:12:16.041 --> 00:12:18.489
It doesn't matter though.
Not really.


00:12:18.593 --> 00:12:19.524
What do you want?


00:12:19.662 --> 00:12:21.696
You have to do things.


00:12:22.731 --> 00:12:24.179
[FIRE CRACKLING]


00:12:29.868 --> 00:12:31.834
You were so kind to me.


00:12:33.558 --> 00:12:35.041
Thank you for the water.


00:12:35.144 --> 00:12:36.765
