I will.


00:12:38.144 --> 00:12:39.144
I wouldn't.


00:12:39.834 --> 00:12:41.937
Don't tell anyone.


00:12:42.041 --> 00:12:44.075
I wouldn't tell
anyone at all.


00:12:44.179 --> 00:12:45.593
Don't you dare.


00:12:47.006 --> 00:12:48.524
Get up.


00:12:48.627 --> 00:12:50.213
You need to leave.
This is not okay.


