call the police, okay?


00:12:58.868 --> 00:13:00.593
You got every right
to be upset.


00:13:00.696 --> 00:13:02.524
This is the worst thing
I've ever done.


00:13:02.593 --> 00:13:04.937
This is not okay,
what you're doing. Do you get that?


