It's just sitting here.


00:15:26.455 --> 00:15:31.179
<i>Well, she was</i>
<i>probably just senile.</i> Maybe.


00:15:31.282 --> 00:15:35.179
<i>You said she was old.</i>
<i>Maybe she was confused,</i> <i>off her meds?</i>


00:15:39.317 --> 00:15:40.972
I don't know what she was.


00:15:41.075 --> 00:15:43.696
<i>But she's gone now?</i>
Yeah.


00:15:44.627 --> 00:15:45.558
Yeah.


00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.731
<i>I'm sure you're okay,</i>
<i>Baby Doll.</i>


00:15:48.868 --> 00:15:50.834
<i>If not, go over to Mrs. Trott.</i>


00:15:50.903 --> 00:15:52.420
Well, she's still
out of town.


00:15:52.558 --> 00:15:56.627
<i>I feel like that woman</i>
<i>never sits still</i> <i>since her husband died.</i>


00:15:56.731 --> 00:15:58.868
