<i>Polly. You gotta focus.</i>


00:16:24.937 --> 00:16:26.144
<i>This is a big deal, sweetie.</i>


00:16:26.248 --> 00:16:27.593
<i>And Lainie called--</i>
Yeah, I know.


00:16:27.696 --> 00:16:29.248
That's why I got off
of work early,


00:16:29.317 --> 00:16:30.662
and I was planning
on doing that right now.


00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.593
And I know
what Lainie fuckin' did. <i>Okay, okay.</i>


00:16:32.662 --> 00:16:34.903
<i>Honey, it's gonna be okay.</i>
<i>I'm</i>32 years old.


00:16:34.972 --> 00:16:36.455
I've had
job interviews before,


00:16:36.558 --> 00:16:37.937
