about going back to school.


00:16:38.041 --> 00:16:40.179
I don't even know
if that's what I want. <i>I know. I know.</i>


00:16:40.282 --> 00:16:42.593
<i>But we have</i>
<i>to start somewhere.</i>


00:16:42.731 --> 00:16:44.282
<i>I've been praying on it,</i>
<i>you know?</i>


00:16:44.386 --> 00:16:47.834
Yeah, I was
being a bitch. Sorry.


00:16:47.972 --> 00:16:51.524
<i>No. I just don't</i>
<i>want you distracted,</i> <i>that's all.</i>


00:16:51.627 --> 00:16:54.593
Okay... [SIGHS] let me
call you back in a bit.


00:16:54.662 --> 00:16:58.179
I'm gonna try on some outfits.
I'll send you some pictures.


00:16:58.282 --> 00:17:01.317
Are you gonna
be up for a while? <i>I'll be up, Baby Doll.</i>


00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:03.110
Okay. Love you. Bye.


