01:02:23.972 --> 01:02:27.558
You killed them.
<i>No. You did.</i>


01:02:27.662 --> 01:02:29.903
<i>Bad girl. Bad.</i>


01:02:30.731 --> 01:02:31.937
I made a mistake!


01:02:32.041 --> 01:02:35.489
<i>There are no mistakes!</i>
<i>Only choices.</i>


01:02:35.593 --> 01:02:37.351
<i>Right and wrong.</i>


01:02:37.489 --> 01:02:41.110
<i>You saw what you wanted.</i>
<i>You gave what</i> <i>you wanted to give.</i>


01:02:41.179 --> 01:02:44.248
<i>But did you truly</i>
<i>need it, Auntie P?</i>


01:02:44.351 --> 01:02:47.662
<i>Or did you truly need</i>
<i>to give something easy?</i>


01:02:47.765 --> 01:02:49.179
It wasn't easy...


01:02:49.282 --> 01:02:51.937
<i>You must suffer</i>
<i>not to suffer.</i>


01:02:53.317 --> 01:02:55.662
<i>Are you ready to play more?</i>


01:02:56.282 --> 01:02:57.972
<i>What do you love?</i>


01:02:59.110 --> 01:03:01.593
<i>What do you love?</i>
I loved them.


01:03:03.558 --> 01:03:04.800
<i>Did you?</i>


01:03:05.937 --> 01:03:09.248
<i>Think hard. Real hard.</i>


01:03:09.972 --> 01:03:11.455
I loved you!


01:03:20.006 --> 01:03:21.558
<i>I wanna play.</i>


01:03:21.662 --> 01:03:23.317
<i>Can we play?</i>


01:03:25.972 --> 01:03:30.213
<i>Read me a story. Please.</i>


01:03:32.179 --> 01:03:35.627
<i>This little piggy</i>
<i>went to market.</i>


01:03:35.731 --> 01:03:38.558
<i>This little piggy stayed home.</i>


01:03:38.662 --> 01:03:42.351
<i>This little piggy</i>
<i>had roast beef.</i>


01:03:42.420 --> 01:03:45.627
<i>This little piggy had none.</i>


01:03:45.731 --> 01:03:51.627
<i>And this little piggy</i>
<i>went "wee wee wee"</i>


01:03:51.731 --> 01:03:56.041
[POLLY BREATHING SHAKILY]
<i>all the way home.</i>


01:03:56.386 --> 01:03:57.972
You're dead.


01:03:58.075 --> 01:04:03.489
<i>No. I'm right here.</i>
<i>With you.</i>


01:04:06.144 --> 01:04:09.489
<i>I think you should</i>
<i>take my nose.</i>


01:04:11.041 --> 01:04:14.351
<i>Won't it be funny, Auntie P?</i>


01:04:15.696 --> 01:04:19.144
<i>Mmm. You should take my eyes.</i>


01:04:21.144 --> 01:04:22.972
<i>Are you sure?</i>


01:04:23.593 --> 01:04:24.868
<i>Really?</i>


01:04:26.455 --> 01:04:28.386
<i>No!</i>


01:04:28.765 --> 01:04:30.627
<i>No! No!</i>


01:04:30.731 --> 01:04:32.386
<i>No!</i>


01:04:41.731 --> 01:04:46.110
<i>What if you're wrong,</i>
<i>Auntie P?</i> <i>What will happen?</i>


01:04:46.800 --> 01:04:49.041
<i>I bet it's bad.</i>


01:04:50.455 --> 01:04:52.179
You're wrong.
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:04:54.903 --> 01:04:56.317
<i>Will it be over?</i>


01:04:57.627 --> 01:05:01.420
Something you loved.


01:05:03.455 --> 01:05:05.179
<i>Will it stop?</i>


01:05:06.075 --> 01:05:07.800
I'll always love you.


01:05:17.317 --> 01:05:19.662
[ECHOING]
<i>We will see.</i>


01:05:22.868 --> 01:05:24.903
[LINE DISCONNECTS]


01:05:39.524 --> 01:05:40.834
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:05:47.696 --> 01:05:49.937
[FOOTSTEPS THUMPING]


01:06:04.834 --> 01:06:07.006
LAINIE:
What are you doing, babe?


01:06:07.110 --> 01:06:11.662
Have you been here long?
'Cause, um, Mark thought he heard someone.


01:06:12.386 --> 01:06:13.627
Lainie.


01:06:15.627 --> 01:06:17.868
Are you okay?
I called you earlier.


01:06:17.937 --> 01:06:19.179
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:06:20.765 --> 01:06:22.282
Your hand.
[GASPS]


01:06:24.455 --> 01:06:26.248
Polly, what's going on?
Aly?


01:06:26.351 --> 01:06:28.800
Polly?
Are you okay?


01:06:30.627 --> 01:06:31.972
[ALY YELPS]


01:06:32.868 --> 01:06:34.386
Are you okay?
Mama!


01:06:34.489 --> 01:06:36.627
You're okay. You're okay.


01:06:36.765 --> 01:06:38.006
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.


01:06:38.110 --> 01:06:40.248
LAINIE: Everything
okay up there? It's okay.


01:06:40.317 --> 01:06:43.041
We're fine.
It's all right. Sorry.


01:06:43.144 --> 01:06:46.455
What's happening, Auntie P?
I'm sorry. It's okay.


01:06:47.489 --> 01:06:51.317
I was being silly.
You are silly.


01:06:56.110 --> 01:06:57.903
Baby Doll...


01:07:02.351 --> 01:07:04.696
This little piggie...


01:07:05.317 --> 01:07:07.489
I wanna play, Auntie P.


01:07:07.627 --> 01:07:09.972
[POLLY GASPING]


01:07:12.041 --> 01:07:14.593
[ALY LAUGHING]


01:07:18.144 --> 01:07:19.386
Come here.


01:07:22.179 --> 01:07:24.593
I wanna show you something.


01:07:25.110 --> 01:07:26.386
[THUDDING]


01:07:29.282 --> 01:07:31.696
You should come see.


01:07:32.455 --> 01:07:33.868
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:07:35.006 --> 01:07:37.317
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]


01:07:41.868 --> 01:07:43.662
I wanna play, Auntie P!


01:07:43.800 --> 01:07:45.937
[SHRIEKS, GASPS]


01:07:46.041 --> 01:07:47.075
I love you.


01:07:47.765 --> 01:07:48.765
[KNIFE STABS]


01:07:50.282 --> 01:07:51.696
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:08:04.937 --> 01:08:06.800
[SAND POURING]


01:08:08.834 --> 01:08:10.765
[UNEASY MUSIC]


01:08:11.765 --> 01:08:13.041
No.


01:08:13.110 --> 01:08:14.800
You're a liar.


01:08:14.903 --> 01:08:16.110
I did everything.


01:08:17.006 --> 01:08:18.006
I did everything.


01:08:18.075 --> 01:08:20.179
I gave you everything.


01:08:20.282 --> 01:08:24.420
Something I hate,
something I need, something I love, I did it.


01:08:24.524 --> 01:08:26.041
[SOBBING]
What more do you want?


01:08:31.662 --> 01:08:32.765
Where are you?


01:08:38.110 --> 01:08:39.800
[LINE BEEPING]


01:08:41.248 --> 01:08:42.558
Talk to me.


01:08:55.662 --> 01:08:57.593
Just stop. Please.


01:08:57.696 --> 01:08:59.731
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]


01:09:00.593 --> 01:09:01.731
[SOBBING]


01:09:02.800 --> 01:09:04.110
Anything you want...


01:09:07.386 --> 01:09:08.627
Take it.


01:09:09.972 --> 01:09:11.282
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:09:16.455 --> 01:09:17.800
[SOBBING]


01:09:45.662 --> 01:09:48.041
[SCREAMING]


01:09:48.765 --> 01:09:50.489
[VOICE SCREAMING]


01:09:51.593 --> 01:09:53.455
No! No!


01:09:54.282 --> 01:09:56.317
No! No!


01:10:01.903 --> 01:10:02.972
[SOBBING]


01:10:04.041 --> 01:10:05.213
Let me go!


01:10:05.317 --> 01:10:07.041
Why won't you let me go?


01:10:11.937 --> 01:10:13.868
What is it? What is left?


01:10:13.972 --> 01:10:15.317
[SOBBING]


01:10:25.903 --> 01:10:26.972
She...


01:10:27.075 --> 01:10:28.386
[PANTING]


01:10:29.006 --> 01:10:31.903
She knocked on the door.


01:10:35.731 --> 01:10:38.110
She knew what she wanted.


01:10:41.937 --> 01:10:43.282
She gave it to me.


01:10:52.593 --> 01:10:53.800
She gave it to me.


01:10:57.420 --> 01:10:58.627
POLLY: Hello!


01:11:02.420 --> 01:11:04.144
Anyone home?


01:11:04.213 --> 01:11:05.972
[RINGS DOORBELL]


01:11:06.041 --> 01:11:07.110
Hello?


01:11:08.144 --> 01:11:09.179
[EXHALES]


01:11:11.765 --> 01:11:12.903
Somebody...


01:11:23.282 --> 01:11:24.524
Hello?


01:11:26.282 --> 01:11:27.593
Hello?


01:11:29.386 --> 01:11:31.041
Can somebody help me?


01:11:33.351 --> 01:11:34.558
Please.


01:11:40.489 --> 01:11:41.731
Somebody.


01:11:43.455 --> 01:11:45.386
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:11:52.075 --> 01:11:53.800
[DOORBELL RINGS]


01:11:59.455 --> 01:12:01.317
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]


01:12:24.110 --> 01:12:25.765
Thank you.


01:12:25.868 --> 01:12:27.937
Thank you.
I'm sorry it's so late.


01:12:29.075 --> 01:12:30.110
Are you okay?


01:12:31.627 --> 01:12:34.110
I was just
dropping something off.


01:12:34.248 --> 01:12:36.248
My sister's
just down the street.


01:12:36.351 --> 01:12:38.868
I was supposed
to bring her something. Um...


01:12:38.972 --> 01:12:43.524
I was supposed
to go there, but I... I forgot my key.


01:12:43.627 --> 01:12:45.282
I'm... I'm locked out.


01:12:45.386 --> 01:12:48.765
Sorry, I don't understand.
Do you... Do you need something?


01:12:48.903 --> 01:12:50.800
Um, I think I just need...


01:12:52.662 --> 01:12:56.455
I just...
I just need to come in. Just for a second.


01:12:56.593 --> 01:12:59.524
Uh, you know,
this is actually my parent's house.


01:12:59.627 --> 01:13:02.213
I'm just here visiting
for the holidays. So...


01:13:02.351 --> 01:13:06.593
They're... They're at
a work party right now. I... I can't...


01:13:08.524 --> 01:13:10.455
I just need
to call my sister.


01:13:11.662 --> 01:13:14.075
She just lives
right down the street.


01:13:15.006 --> 01:13:16.075
Right there.


01:13:21.144 --> 01:13:22.075
My name is Polly.


01:13:22.144 --> 01:13:24.006
[RUMBLING]


01:13:26.627 --> 01:13:28.213
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]


01:13:29.868 --> 01:13:32.006
[SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING]


01:13:42.317 --> 01:13:43.662
[SNIFFLES]


01:13:45.041 --> 01:13:46.179
Are you okay?


01:13:55.179 --> 01:13:56.075
No.


01:13:58.351 --> 01:13:59.455
No, I'm not.


01:14:05.317 --> 01:14:06.593
I'm really sorry.


01:14:08.351 --> 01:14:11.558
I'm sorry to bother you.
I just don't know what else to do.


01:14:11.627 --> 01:14:14.972
But if I am freaking you out,
you can call the police. I just...


01:14:15.489 --> 01:14:17.524
No, I'm just...


01:14:17.593 --> 01:14:19.041
You can tell me
what happened.


01:14:22.696 --> 01:14:23.800
I can't.


01:14:31.420 --> 01:14:33.696
Uh, I'll be right back.


01:14:49.420 --> 01:14:50.489
[CAT MEOWS]


01:15:02.110 --> 01:15:03.627
[SCREAMS]


01:15:29.662 --> 01:15:32.179
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]


01:15:50.593 --> 01:15:51.800
[EXHALES]


01:15:55.006 --> 01:15:57.558
My... My parents will be home
in a few minutes.


01:15:59.800 --> 01:16:04.524
Here. Drink this. I...
I made some tea tonight.


01:16:04.627 --> 01:16:06.213
It might help warm you up.


01:16:11.179 --> 01:16:12.075
What is that?


01:16:14.213 --> 01:16:15.524
Your name is Tara?


01:16:20.386 --> 01:16:22.455
How did you...
How did you know that?


01:16:23.282 --> 01:16:24.213
I just do.


01:16:30.282 --> 01:16:31.455
Thank you for the tea.


01:16:32.179 --> 01:16:33.455
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:16:34.903 --> 01:16:37.558
That was really,
really nice of you.


01:16:37.627 --> 01:16:40.420
Look, um, I think...
I think that you should maybe go...


01:16:40.558 --> 01:16:42.627
I just knew it.
I can't explain it.


01:16:45.731 --> 01:16:48.455
You'll understand. You will.


01:16:50.317 --> 01:16:51.455
Soon.


01:16:53.248 --> 01:16:54.524
What's going on?


01:16:59.765 --> 01:17:01.144
I don't want to be me.


01:17:04.937 --> 01:17:06.696
Is that a weird thing to say?


01:17:10.627 --> 01:17:11.903
It's true.


01:17:13.489 --> 01:17:16.110
Tired of feeling
like none of it matters.


01:17:17.317 --> 01:17:18.558
I want it to...


01:17:19.903 --> 01:17:21.006
so bad.


01:17:23.868 --> 01:17:25.800
I can change everything.


01:17:29.558 --> 01:17:30.800
But not me.


01:17:35.455 --> 01:17:37.800
I try so fucking hard.


01:17:41.110 --> 01:17:43.627
I bang my head
against the fucking wall.


01:17:46.248 --> 01:17:47.627
Every minute...


01:17:50.489 --> 01:17:51.868
every second.


01:17:52.972 --> 01:17:54.800
But nothing changes.


01:17:57.006 --> 01:17:58.524
It doesn't get better.


01:18:00.903 --> 01:18:02.627
I'm still right here.


01:18:07.420 --> 01:18:09.041
And it's all the same.


01:18:10.144 --> 01:18:11.731
What do you want?


01:18:11.868 --> 01:18:14.006
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]


01:18:16.972 --> 01:18:18.386
For it to stop.


01:18:26.075 --> 01:18:27.696
I'm going to start now.


01:18:29.489 --> 01:18:31.213
Your parents
aren't coming home.


01:18:31.317 --> 01:18:34.351
That wasn't true. Was it?


01:18:38.868 --> 01:18:40.489
I think that you...
I know. I know.


01:18:41.937 --> 01:18:43.213
But it doesn't matter.


01:18:46.455 --> 01:18:48.075
This belongs to you now.


01:18:52.144 --> 01:18:54.558
No, no. Get up.


01:18:54.696 --> 01:18:57.351
Get up. Look,
I was just trying to be nice. You really need to leave.


01:18:57.455 --> 01:18:59.386
I don't know
what your fucking deal is.


01:19:05.903 --> 01:19:07.524
You're going to die.


01:19:10.179 --> 01:19:12.110
[DOOR CREAKS, CLOSES]


01:19:13.144 --> 01:19:14.524
[DOOR OPENS]


01:19:30.144 --> 01:19:32.593
[SLOW SUSPENSEFUL
MUSIC PLAYING]


01:20:00.800 --> 01:20:02.075
I'm sorry.


01:20:03.800 --> 01:20:05.834
[EERIE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:20:23.524 --> 01:20:25.696
THE WOMAN: It wants me...
[GASPS]


01:20:26.420 --> 01:20:27.731
...to kill you.


01:20:32.455 --> 01:20:34.524
It won't let me go.


01:20:37.213 --> 01:20:39.524
You have to do things.


01:20:41.834 --> 01:20:44.317
It never, never stops.


01:20:45.972 --> 01:20:47.834
Get away from me.
[GASPS]


01:20:47.972 --> 01:20:49.834
It wants you!
No!


01:20:49.972 --> 01:20:52.593
Take it.
[BOTH GRUNT]


01:20:52.662 --> 01:20:53.317
No!


01:20:56.903 --> 01:20:57.972
[GASPS]


01:20:59.765 --> 01:21:01.351
[THE WOMAN GRUNTING]


01:21:01.489 --> 01:21:03.179
[CLOCK TOLLING]


01:21:05.903 --> 01:21:06.937
[GLASS BREAKING]


01:21:12.972 --> 01:21:14.593
[BOTH GRUNTING]


01:21:17.144 --> 01:21:18.386
[GRUNTS]


01:21:19.524 --> 01:21:21.800
[GASPING]
[THE WOMAN GROANING]


01:21:28.524 --> 01:21:30.006
[CHOKING]


01:21:48.696 --> 01:21:50.524
Stop.
Die.


01:21:50.627 --> 01:21:52.420
No! No!


01:21:53.662 --> 01:21:54.627
[THE WOMAN GROANS]


01:21:57.868 --> 01:21:59.765
[SCREAMING]


01:22:03.075 --> 01:22:04.420
Please.


01:22:05.420 --> 01:22:07.593
[GROANS]
[GRUNTS]


01:22:12.075 --> 01:22:13.972
[CHOKING, GROANING]


01:22:21.282 --> 01:22:22.489
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:22:25.800 --> 01:22:26.903
Why?


01:22:29.627 --> 01:22:30.834
Why? Tell me.


01:22:31.593 --> 01:22:32.696
[COUGHS]


01:22:32.765 --> 01:22:33.972
Why me?


01:22:35.110 --> 01:22:36.800
[BREATHING LABORIOUSLY]


01:22:40.213 --> 01:22:42.420
Someone knocked on my door.


01:22:48.110 --> 01:22:49.627
And I just opened it.


01:22:52.248 --> 01:22:54.075
No one ever knocks.


01:22:54.455 --> 01:22:55.662
Not anymore.


01:22:56.489 --> 01:23:00.041
Then someone finally...


01:23:01.627 --> 01:23:02.937
[GROANS]


01:23:04.524 --> 01:23:06.696
They could have
knocked anywhere.


01:23:08.696 --> 01:23:10.696
I could have
knocked anywhere.


01:23:13.075 --> 01:23:14.144
But I didn't.


01:23:16.868 --> 01:23:19.075
I think it chooses us...


01:23:21.213 --> 01:23:24.868
because we are broken.


01:23:27.868 --> 01:23:29.696
You were nice. I can tell.


01:23:33.834 --> 01:23:35.282
It doesn't matter.


01:23:37.627 --> 01:23:39.386
I tried so hard.


01:23:40.834 --> 01:23:43.593
The things we do
to ourselves.


01:23:43.662 --> 01:23:45.282
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:23:49.420 --> 01:23:51.179
It's never enough.


01:23:54.282 --> 01:23:57.662
Alas, everything I was...


01:23:59.386 --> 01:24:01.593
everything I could be...


01:24:07.558 --> 01:24:09.558
I was so afraid.


01:24:12.903 --> 01:24:14.937
The box needs that.


01:24:16.006 --> 01:24:18.731
The sand needs it.


01:24:23.937 --> 01:24:25.972
Don't be afraid of dying.


01:24:27.489 --> 01:24:31.006
Don't be afraid.


01:24:32.868 --> 01:24:34.420
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:24:40.351 --> 01:24:41.627
Thank you.


01:24:50.282 --> 01:24:52.627
[SOLEMN MUSIC PLAYING]


01:25:03.248 --> 01:25:04.627
[BREATH TREMBLES]


01:25:19.765 --> 01:25:22.006
POLLY: <i>Aly's five.</i>
<i>She's about to turn six.</i>


01:25:22.144 --> 01:25:25.386
We're having a birthday party
for her next week.


01:25:25.455 --> 01:25:28.144
That's nice.
It's a good age.


01:25:28.558 --> 01:25:30.075
I'm sure it is.


01:25:30.144 --> 01:25:31.662
So much more to do.


01:25:33.420 --> 01:25:34.834
I'm gonna start now.


01:25:36.006 --> 01:25:36.834
What?


01:25:38.248 --> 01:25:39.420
Ma'am, are you okay?


01:25:40.937 --> 01:25:44.765
If you wanna
give me that card, I can call you a car or...


01:25:44.834 --> 01:25:48.662
I can get my phone
and call you an Uber.


01:25:48.800 --> 01:25:50.627
THE WOMAN:
<i>This will be for you now.</i>


01:25:52.731 --> 01:25:54.903
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]


01:26:02.558 --> 01:26:05.593
MOTHER:
<i>You are going to die.</i>


01:26:06.248 --> 01:26:07.731
<i>Unless...</i>


01:26:07.868 --> 01:26:10.041
<i>Unless, unless,</i>
<i>unless, unless,</i> <i>unless, unless...</i>


01:26:10.144 --> 01:26:11.317
[GIRL SCREAMING]


01:26:11.420 --> 01:26:13.593
FATHER: <i>You don't want</i>
<i>that sand running out.</i>


01:26:13.696 --> 01:26:15.317
MOTHER:
<i>Unless, unless, unless...</i>


01:26:15.386 --> 01:26:17.903
<i>It's too hard, too scary.</i>


01:26:20.386 --> 01:26:22.524
[SOBBING]
I won't do it anymore.


01:26:22.627 --> 01:26:24.524
GIRL:
<i>Come and see.</i>


01:26:24.593 --> 01:26:26.627
MOTHER:
<i>Did you feel something then?</i>


01:26:26.731 --> 01:26:29.179
<i>You whore!</i>
<i>You said you will not desire.</i>


01:26:29.282 --> 01:26:30.282
<i>Help me!</i>


01:26:30.351 --> 01:26:32.696
<i>What do you love?</i>


01:26:32.834 --> 01:26:34.800
[GIRL TALKING DISTORTEDLY]


01:26:34.903 --> 01:26:36.834
<i>No! No! No!</i>


01:26:36.903 --> 01:26:40.386
FATHER: <i>You're wasting time,</i>
<i>Baby Doll.</i>[ECHOING]


01:26:41.972 --> 01:26:44.662
MOTHER:
<i>You are going to die.</i>


01:26:44.731 --> 01:26:47.386
[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:26:48.248 --> 01:26:50.317
POLLY:
<i>I don't want to be me.</i>


01:26:50.420 --> 01:26:51.868
WOMAN IN MIRROR:
<i>You are dead!</i>


01:26:53.696 --> 01:26:56.213
MOTHER:
<i>Unless, unless, unless...</i>


01:26:56.351 --> 01:26:59.041
[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:26:59.144 --> 01:27:00.834
WOMAN IN MIRROR:
<i>You are dead!</i>


01:27:00.937 --> 01:27:01.937
[SCREAMS]


01:27:11.937 --> 01:27:13.868
[RUMBLING]


01:27:32.662 --> 01:27:35.455
[SLOW INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC
PLAYING]


01:28:15.558 --> 01:28:16.868
LAINIE: Polly?


01:28:54.006 --> 01:28:55.696
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:29:18.110 --> 01:29:19.179
POLLY: Aly!


01:29:19.282 --> 01:29:21.248
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:29:22.110 --> 01:29:23.937
[ALY LAUGHING]


01:29:26.868 --> 01:29:28.593
Oh, I love you.


01:29:29.868 --> 01:29:31.110
I love you.


01:29:33.420 --> 01:29:35.006
[ALY CHUCKLES]


01:29:38.903 --> 01:29:40.696
Mama's pissed at you.


01:29:41.903 --> 01:29:44.110
Mama's always pissed at me.
[CHUCKLES]


01:29:46.075 --> 01:29:47.558
What happened to you?


01:29:58.386 --> 01:29:59.903
What did you do?


01:30:05.041 --> 01:30:07.075
Tell Mom
I'll be right back, okay?


01:30:09.489 --> 01:30:10.662
Okay?


01:30:26.558 --> 01:30:27.903
[EXHALES]


01:30:39.627 --> 01:30:41.282
[DOORBELL RINGS]


01:30:43.972 --> 01:30:46.006
[EERIE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:30:56.144 --> 01:30:58.110
You can't play, okay?


01:30:59.455 --> 01:31:02.179
Give it to me.
What?


01:31:02.282 --> 01:31:04.558
Listen to me.
I should never have given it to you.


01:31:05.558 --> 01:31:06.627
Give me the box.


01:31:08.213 --> 01:31:10.662
What are you talking about?
Do it, now.


01:31:13.868 --> 01:31:15.110
Who are you?


01:31:16.179 --> 01:31:17.041
What?


01:31:18.627 --> 01:31:20.213
I... I think
you're confused.


01:31:20.317 --> 01:31:22.834
My parents and I,
we just got back.


01:31:22.937 --> 01:31:24.972
We were on vacation
for Christmas.


01:31:26.110 --> 01:31:27.696
You have the wrong house.


01:31:30.593 --> 01:31:31.972
Oh...


01:31:33.041 --> 01:31:34.041
I thought... I'm sorry.


01:31:34.179 --> 01:31:36.558
It's all right.
I'm sorry.


01:32:01.317 --> 01:32:02.696
I'll be in in a minute.


01:32:06.524 --> 01:32:07.903
LAINIE: Come on.


01:32:09.455 --> 01:32:11.420
[LAINIE SPEAKS INDISTINCTLY]
[SLOW INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING]


01:32:11.558 --> 01:32:12.765
[EXHALES]


01:32:53.213 --> 01:32:55.248
[CELL PHONE VIBRATING]


01:33:03.627 --> 01:33:05.800
[CELL PHONE CONTINUES
VIBRATING]


01:33:05.903 --> 01:33:07.179
[BREATH TREMBLES]


01:33:23.593 --> 01:33:25.972
[CELL PHONE CONTINUES
VIBRATING]


01:33:30.248 --> 01:33:31.765
[BREATH TREMBLING]


01:33:49.455 --> 01:33:51.213
[VIBRATING STOPS]


01:34:15.627 --> 01:34:17.213
[CLOCK CHIMING]


01:34:45.903 --> 01:34:47.213
[CHIMING STOPS]


01:34:58.937 --> 01:35:00.868
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:35:42.937 --> 01:35:48.558
Something you... want.


01:35:51.937 --> 01:35:54.558
[CELL PHONE VIBRATING]
[LOUD RUMBLING]


01:35:57.110 --> 01:35:59.282
[CELL PHONE
CONTINUES VIBRATING]


01:36:03.696 --> 01:36:06.179
[SLOW OMINOUS MUSIC
PLAYING]

